	(gr_text "0) Recheck P- and P+ diff pair clearences if you are planning to use Probe connecor as USB/CAN connector\n1) Take length of your standoffs as height of your motor.\n   F.e: LDO-36STH20-1004AHG has height of 20mm, so this length your standoffs should be\n2) It is recomended to use some soft non-conductive material to prevent short curcuit\nStick it to back side of your motor"
